  "positionNow": {
    "note": "The synchronous clock payload. Built as a dictionary literal on iOS and a WritableMap on Android, parsed by parseNativePlaybackPositionNow. A key misspelled on one platform makes that parse return null and the player silently falls back to the polled clock on THAT PLATFORM ONLY, with every suite green — which is why both spellings are compared here rather than the parser alone.",
